7. Direct Recruitment:- No person shall be eligible for appointment to any post in the service by Direct Recruitment unless he satisfies the Corporation.
i. that he is of sound health, possesses active habits and is free from any bodily defect or infirmity;
ii. that his character and antecedents are such as to qualify him for such service; and

iii. that he has completed the age of eighteen years.
Note:-(1) The Competent Authority may, by a general or special order specify the standards of physical fitness to be fulfilled by candidates and different standards may be prescribed for different categories of posts;
